1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,880
2 years later

25
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,920
Rank 3 demonic energy is equivalent to Foundation Establishment.

26
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,040
10 times that is Core Formation.

27
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,160
If I extrapolate,

28
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:03,760
Soul Transformation requires rank 30 000.

29
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:08,720
I barely have enough celestial jades to reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

30
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,440
Using this demonic energy and converting it to celestial spiritual energy

31
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:15,240
is currently my best method to breakthrough to Ascendant.

32
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:19,600
In these 2 years,

33
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,360
the tribe has grown considerably.

34
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,520
It's really crowded now.

35
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:27,560
The souls within their Soul Flags need to be nurtured many times

36
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,560
to reach their full power.

37
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:33,600
Instead of teaching them how to nurture the souls,

38
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:37,240
I might as well put the Billion-Soul Flag here as a defensive formation.

39
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,080
Soul Refining Tribe,

40
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,400
release your souls into the black clouds

41
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,080
twice a day.

42
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,200
It will temper your souls.

43
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,520
Thank you, Ancestor,

44
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:55,960
for giving us this divine technique !

45
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:07,680
Brother Thirteen,

46
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:10,800
what does it feel like to cultivate the Soul Refining spell ?

47
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,640
Why do you ask him ?

48
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:17,960
He's crippled.

49
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,600
He doesn't even talk anymore.

50
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,240
Everyone, run ! There's a demon beast !

51
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,440
Everyone, run !

52
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:31,720
Run !

53
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:38,800
Run !

54
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,490
Brother Thirteen...

55
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,760
Ancestor,

56
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:01,240
when Thirteen was hunting,

57
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:03,040
he encountered a rare demon beast

58
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,120
By the time I arrived,

59
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,240
it was already too late.

60
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,440
I understand,

61
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,320
you may leave.

62
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,120
Let's go.

63
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,040
His meridians are shattered

64
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:25,800
but how could he have demonic energy of rank 2 ?

65
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,960
He forcibly absorbed demonic energy to store it inside his flesh.

66
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,240
It must have been excruciatingly painful

67
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,400
but he endured it for 2 whole years.

68
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,360
His determination is undeniable.

69
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,840
But with his meridians shattered,

70
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,560
the only thing that can save him now

71
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,840
is the Ancient God Tactic.

72
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,560
But this technique...

73
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,080
isn't something I can give so easily.

74
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,520
Thank you Ancestor, for saving my life !

75
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:10,360
You forcibly absorbed demonic energy.

76
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,400
Do you know the more you absorb,

77
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,880
the closer you are to death ?

78
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,320
Thirteen knows.

79
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,480
But I just thought that

80
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,840
by forcibly absorbing demonic energy,

81
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:21,640
I might still have a sliver of a chance to cultivate.

82
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,880
I don't want to be useless to the tribe

83
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,000
or to the Ancestor !

84
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,800
I can give you a body refining method

85
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,960
that will allow you to assimilate demonic energy into your flesh.

86
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Although you won't be able to use spells,

87
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,520
your body will become stronger and stronger.

88
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,360
This body refining method is extremely painful.

89
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:42,000
If you mess up, even I might not be able to save you.

90
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:43,960
Can you withstand it ?

91
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,240
Thirteen

92
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,800
will definitely not let the Ancestor down !

93
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,480
I'm very familiar

94
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,960
with that look in his eyes...

95
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:05,040
If he can cultivate the Giant Demon Clan's body refining method,

96
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:08,040
I will teach him the first layer of the Ancient God Tactic.

97
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,520
It all depends on his fate.

98
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,320
We pay respects to the Ancestor.

99
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:19,240
This child is the one I mentioned before, Hu Pao.

100
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,120
He was born with rank 2 demonic energy.

101
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,960
In just a few short months,

102
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:26,680
he has already refined 13 Soul Flags.

103
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:27,920
Greetings, Ancestor.

104
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:27,320
Hu Pao\NSoul Refining Tribe

105
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,840
Hu Pao has already cultivated the Soul Refining spell to the fourth stage

106
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,040
and I have 5 primary souls.

107
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,840
Ancestor, have a look.

108
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,840
Don't disrespect the Ancestor !

109
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,880
This child is extremely talented.

110
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,680
He might be even more talented than Red Butterfly.

111
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,960
If we let him grow freely within the tribe,

112
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,240
he might cause trouble in the future.

113
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,840
You will cultivate by my side.

114
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,240
Hu Pao pays respects to Master !

115
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,800
The Soul Refining Tribe is here !

116
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,000
Now surrender peacefully !

117
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,200
Those who lay down their arms

118
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,520
will be spared !

119
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:30,880
Soul Refining Tribe,

120
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,640
deploy our great formation !

121
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,480
The Holy Soul Refining Sect

122
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,400
shall live forever !

123
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,520
4 years ago,

124
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:45,120
I wasn't in a hurry to join Ancient Demon City's army

125
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,920
because I didn't have a foothold.

126
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,880
Now that the Soul Refining Tribe's influence is established,

127
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,480
it's time to leave.

128
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,800
From now on,

129
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,200
the Soul Refining Tribe will cease to expand.

130
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,600
You shall cultivate with all your might.

131
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,880
Ouyang Hua,

132
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,840
if the tribe encounters danger in the future,

133
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,880
use this jade slip to send me a message.

134
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:31,080
Junior will fulfill his duty !

135
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,400
We bid farewell to the Ancestor !

136
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:45,600
Ancient Demon City\NDemon Spirit Land

137
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:44,880
Long time no see.

138
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,800
Let's go, let's go.

139
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,040
Where is the commander of this place ?

140
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,800
Where did those savages come from ?

141
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:01,440
The Commander is not someone you can meet like that !

142
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,400
Scram !

143
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,640
How dare you !

144
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,600
You dare to attack Ancient Demon City !?

145
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,160
Presumptuous !

146
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,480
That punch...

147
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:16,240
was wrong.

148
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,640
Thirteen was reckless.

149
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,360
But in my eyes,

150
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,600
anyone who disrespects the Ancestor

151
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,200
is an enemy.

152
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,600
I mean your punching technique was wrong.

153
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,960
You used all your strength but 40% of the power was lost

154
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,080
because you weren't able to control your heart.

155
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,000
With your current strength,

156
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,640
that demon soldier wouldn't have withstood the blow.

157
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:35,760
You're courting death !

158
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,440
Watch carefully

159
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,600
how I punch.

160
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,280
Although body refining is different from spells,

161
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,280
being in control is still the crux.

162
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:59,160
On the cultivation path, only the strong reign supreme.

163
00:09:59,280 --> 00:09:59,800
Remember,

164
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,520
don't be belligerent

165
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,600
but never fear battle.

166
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,720
We pay respects to Commander Yao !

167
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,520
The Blood Ancestor's daughter...

168
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,600
This Yao Xixue always acts domineeringly.

169
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,160
She doesn't have good intentions.

170
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,600
Wang Lin,

171
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,320
I presume you've also come

172
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:29,360
to Ancient Demon City in order to gain military merits.

173
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,520
The Demon General ordered you

174
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:32,680
to follow me.

175
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,080
Given this woman's arrogance,

176
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,400
she wouldn't willingly relay messages like that.

177
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,800
The Demon General who defeated her

178
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,880
must be extraordinarily powerful.

179
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,640
Wait for me in the city.

180
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,000
Understood !

181
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:53,920
Left Wing Demon General's Manor\NAncient Demon City

182
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,080
Over 10 Soul Transformation cultivators

183
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:08,080
and many are at Late stage...

184
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,480
I saw in Luo Yun's memories that this Demon General

185
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,240
has subdued many Soul Transformation cultivators

186
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,240
and has never been defeated on the battlefield.

187
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,840
He must be a powerhouse who has reached Ascendant.

188
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,760
Your Excellency,

189
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,880
I have brought him here.

190
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:31,120
Mo Lihai\NLeft Wing Demon General\NRank 200 000 demonic energy\NPeak Late stage Soul Transformation

191
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:30,440
The foreigner that attacked my demon soldiers

192
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,240
outside the wall...

193
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,000
was it you !?

194
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:37,760
I was wrong.

195
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:40,200
This person's cultivation hasn't reached Ascendant.

196
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,840
If he's only Peak Late stage Soul Transformation.

197
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,240
Then how did he manage

198
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:47,000
to remain undefeated for thousands of years in the Demon Spirit Land

199
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:49,920
and subdue so many powerful cultivators ?

200
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,200
It was me.

201
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,440
Then let me see

202
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:00,520
what kind of skills you have !

203
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,080
Death Finger !

204
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,360
With this finger,

205
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:11,200
you can become an Elder of my manor.

206
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:15,120
Demon Spirit Land has inner and outer positions.

207
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:16,800
Only the outer positions like Commander

208
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,760
and Chief Commander

209
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,200
can command troops

210
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:20,960
and obtain military merits.

211
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,560
I don't want

212
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,040
an inner position.

213
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,880
You actually know the difference between inner and outer positions ?

214
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,640
As long as your strength is sufficient,

215
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:32,480
you foreigners can obtain any outer position.

216
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,080
But that finger from before...

217
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:37,720
is not enough !

218
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,280
You may continue.

219
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:52,520
It's this move...

220
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:53,800
It's coming.

221
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:56,720
This is my Ten Collapse Battle Intent.

222
00:12:56,760 --> 00:12:58,240
If you withstand 8 collapses,

223
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:59,800
you will be a Commander.

224
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:01,840
Withstand them all

225
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,040
and you will be a Chief Commander !

226
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:06,640
First collapse,

227
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:08,680
Mountain Crusher !

228
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:12,880
How many collapses do you think he can take ?

229
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,640
The Ten Collapse Battle Intent can shake the world.

230
00:13:15,640 --> 00:13:17,320
This person's strength is mediocre

231
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:19,800
so I think no more than 2 collapses.

232
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:26,080
Demonic Finger !

233
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:31,800
Such a powerful spell !

234
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,240
Second collapse,

235
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,280
Cloud Splitter !

236
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,480
This second collapse uses the momentum of the first one

237
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,800
to be 10 times stronger.

238
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,640
If I fought to the death,

239
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,200
I'd have to use the Underworld Finger or the God Slaying Chariot.

240
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,760
But there are many powerful experts here,

241
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,800
I can't play all my cards now.

242
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,760
If I can't face it head-on,

243
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,000
then I might as well attack

244
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,560
and seize the initiative.

245
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,080
Celestial Slaughter Art !

246
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,120
Very good !

247
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,720
Under my Battle Intent,

248
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,440
you're one of the few that fights back.

249
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:40,120
Let's see if you can break the remaining 8 collapses !

250
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,120
Third collapse,

251
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,440
Tide Breaker !

252
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,200
Another tenfold increase in strength...

253
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:53,840
how can he unleash spells that exceed his demonic energy cultivation !?

254
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:09,960
Impressive !

255
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,600
But it all ends here.

256
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,720
Fourth collapse...

257
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:22,720
Star Shatterer !

258
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,520
The Ten Collapse Battle Intent is extremely domineering.

259
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,800
With my cultivation,

260
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:43,200
I could only withstand up to the fifth collapse.

261
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,400
If it weren't for the artifact my father gave me,

262
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,440
I wouldn't have gotten the Commander position.

263
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,240
It's normal for Wang Lin

264
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:50,920
to give up here.

265
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:55,440
Resisting the fourth collapse is no easy feat.

266
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:56,920
Back down

267
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,480
and you can become an Elder.

268
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,600
Faith...

269
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,280
Your Ten Collapse Battle Intent

270
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:08,080
is a spell born from faith.

271
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,920
Interesting...

272
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:12,120
The Ten Collapse Battle Intent

273
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:14,880
doesn't come from his demonic power cultivation

274
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:17,840
but from his long-held faith in certain victory on the battlefield.

275
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,680
This move has defeated countless cultivators over thousands of years.

276
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:24,680
Each victory solidified his faith in victory,

277
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:28,720
ultimately creating this Ten Collapse Battle Intent with each collapse stronger than the last.

278
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:31,840
If he keeps winning with this faith in victory,

279
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:35,480
his Ten Collapse Battle Intent will continue to evolve

280
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,360
endlessly.

281
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:40,360
But since it's just faith,

282
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,600
then there is one thing I can use.

283
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,960
Demonic Finger...

284
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,520
Your Dao is fundamentally different from mine,

285
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,880
if you want to truly grasp the essence of the Demonic Finger,

286
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,200
you must transform into a demon.

287
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:15,880
You're the first to ever have a breakthrough during my Ten Collapse Battle Intent.

288
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,800
How interesting !

289
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,040
Let me see

290
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,800
how much progress you've made.

291
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,400
Fifth collapse,

292
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,000
Soul Turner !

293
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,560
Why is my Battle Intent

294
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:46,080
becoming unstable ?

295
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:50,960
I'm seizing your wisdom

296
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,040
to break your Dao.

297
00:17:54,560 --> 00:17:56,120
Although your faith is strong,

298
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:58,840
my demonic thoughts can break it.

299
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,200
Sixth collapse,

300
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:04,240
Wheel Stopper !

301
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,680
The key to breaking your Ten Collapse Battle Intent

302
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,440
isn't cultivation

303
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:29,280
but a contest of faith !

304
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:32,520
Not bad !

305
00:18:33,080 --> 00:18:35,320
I, Mo Lihai, have roamed battlefields

306
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,160
and been victorious for thousands years !

307
00:18:38,040 --> 00:18:40,040
With what faith do you expect to defeat me ?

308
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:41,800
Seventh collapse,

309
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,000
Calamity Annihilation !

310
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,480
One finger...

311
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,400
to become a demon !

312
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:29,840
Mo Lihai...

313
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:31,200
was forced back !

314
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,080
So thrilling !

315
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:51,640
Wang Lin,

316
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,680
I really underestimated you !

317
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,840
Prepare for the last 3 collapses !

318
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,880
Let's see which one of us

319
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:01,240
has the strongest faith !

320
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,200
The demonic thoughts are too strong...

321
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:06,400
They nearly devoured my Dao Heart.

322
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,560
If I transform into a demon,

323
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,880
then even if I win, the loss would outweigh the gains.

324
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:14,440
Demon General,

325
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,000
I forfeit.

326
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,480
Such intense demonic thoughts

327
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:32,440
aren't even your true Dao Heart ?

328
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,520
You know when to retreat

329
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:36,400
and you understand when to make the right decision.

330
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:37,160
Good !

331
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:39,200
Although you didn't break the 10 collapses,

332
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:43,120
with your strength, you are qualified to become a Commander.

333
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,760
I appoint you today as Commander,

334
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:48,560
you will command 10 000 demon soldiers.

335
00:20:49,200 --> 00:20:50,480
You can return to the city.

336
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,040
In 7 days,

337
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:55,040
someone will take you to your assigned barracks.

338
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,120
Thank you, General.

339
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,960
This person entered the manor as a nobody

340
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,280
with his Middle stage Soul Transformation cultivation,

341
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:11,000
but he was able to become a Commander all by himself...

342
00:21:16,420 --> 00:23:21,170
As the mosquito beast rushed across the sky, every tribe it passed activated their protection formation. In their eyes, the mosquito was simply too strong. It was already creating sonic booms just by flying across the sky. The thunderous roars it let out made it seem like thunder was descending upon the earth, creating an overall very shocking scene.\N\NBefore, when Wang Lin first entered the Demon Spirit Land, he didn’t know about the existence of the formations and tribes. The formations also had the ability to hide the people within, so he wasn’t able to find anyone. However, now he had a certain understanding of the Demon Spirit Land, so looking down now, he saw countless tribes.\N\NThere were strong and weak, large and small ones, and the population varied greatly between the tribes.\N\N“If my Soul Refining Tribe can unite all of the tribes in the Demon Spirit Land, it will become a force that will even shock the nine countries here!” Wang Lin’s eyes became cold.

343
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:27,800
I've been walking this path for endless years

344
00:21:24,460 --> 00:21:27,800
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

345
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:33,400
Is it the compass of fate

346
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:33,400
that wrote this outcome for us ?

347
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:39,320
The heavens want to erase your existence,

348
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:45,040
that's the obsession guiding me.

349
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:50,640
Is this the path to uncover

350
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:50,640
truths from falsehoods ?

351
00:21:50,920 --> 00:21:56,240
In a world of murk and shadow,

352
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:56,240
only the flame of truth can light the way.

353
00:21:56,280 --> 00:22:01,960
Look at them all,

354
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:01,960
being carried by the waves.

355
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:06,600
Look at them all,

356
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:06,600
being drowned.

357
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:09,920
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

358
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:13,000
I will let the world refine my soul.

359
00:22:13,130 --> 00:22:18,560
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

360
00:22:14,820 --> 00:22:18,560
I will fight.

361
00:22:18,560 --> 00:22:21,680
I'll break through the abyss of despair

362
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:24,720
to finally learn who I really am.

363
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:30,080
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

364
00:22:26,600 --> 00:22:30,080
I embrace this obsession.

365
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:33,040
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

366
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:35,840
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

367
00:22:35,840 --> 00:22:41,320
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

368
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:41,320
I'll still fight.

369
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:44,680
It's hard to avoid loneliness

370
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:47,720
when you are above everyone else.

371
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:53,400
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

372
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:53,400
be afraid of a firefly ?
